    "text": "WFMZ-TV Online\nwebsite\nNorthampton County, Pennsylvania\n65-year-old man dead after being hit by a vehicle on Route 22 in Northampton Co.\nBy Rob Manch,\n17 hours agoHANOVER TWP., Pa. - State Police are investigating the death of a 65-year-old man who was hit by a vehicle in Northampton County. State Police got the call just after 6 a.m. to respond to the exit ramp off Rte. 22 onto Rte. 512 in Hanover Township. Drivers had seen a man lying in the roadway.\n12",
